d ready for all domestic storefronts (AU, UK, EU Domestic)?\n* For AU, does Avalara apply to all countries, or only NZ and New Caledonia? Specifically do we only call Avalara for those two to calculate tax and duties or for all?\n\n3. UK kids' 0% VAT\n\n* UK kids' clothing should display at 0% VAT. Is the zero rate coming from Avalara at checkout, or are we overriding it in SFCC (e.g. via a zero-rate tax class in BM)?\n* If it is an SFCC override, does that zero rate also apply at cart stage, or does cart currently show 20% incorrectly?\n\n4. EU Domestic cart display\n\n* Before a shipping country is selected at checkout, EU Domestic cart shows a tax figure. What rate is used — a default country rate (e.g. France 20%), or nothing?\n\n5. US / Puerto Rico\n\n* Is Avalara used for Puerto Rico, or does it fall outside the US Domestic tax engine?\n* What duty rate applies to Puerto Rico, and where does that come from? And is it DDP?\n\n| Storefront | Country | DDP/DDU | Line item | Evidence |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| AU | Australia | DDP  DDP to NZ, New Caledonia (shows messaging) | Subtotal Excl. GST | image-20260903-045323.png |\n| US Domestic | US | N/A | Subtotal Excl. Taxes | image-20260903-045332.png |\n| EU Domestic | Italy | N/A | Subtotal Excl. Taxes | image-20260903-045343.png |\n| UK | UK | N/A | Subtotal Excl. VAT | image-20260903-045353.png |\n| US International | Canada | DDP | Subtotal | image-20260903-045400.png |\n| US International | Dominican Republic | DDU | Subtotal | image-20260903-045411.png |\n| HK International | Thailand | DDP | Subtotal Excl. Taxes | image-20260903-045419.png |\n| HK International | Uzbekistan | DDU | Subtotal Excl. Taxes | image-20260903-045429.png |\n| EU International | Switzerland | DDP | Subtotal | image-20260903-045439.png |\n| EU International | South Africa | DDU | Subtotal | image-20260903-045447.png |\n| ME | Qatar | DDP | Subtotal | image-20260903-045452.png |\n| ME | N/A | DDU | N/A | N/A |"
